# The Skyranger taxis on its landing gear during the battle. A soldier in the front row of the
# troop compartment (level 1, right behind the cockpit) switches on drive mode with the Drive button
# or the drive hotkey (D), then clicks where to go: the first click previews the route,
# the second drives. Fences, crops, trees and the walls of farms and town houses (armor up
# to 40) are crushed on the way; big rocks and UFO hulls stop it.
# It moves up to 10 tiles a turn (40 time units), whoever drives. Driven onto an alien,
# it hits it for 100 melee damage: a sectoid goes down, a muton may stop it (rammed).
crafts:
  - type: STR_SKYRANGER
    battleVehicle:
      driverSeats: [[4, 15, 1], [5, 15, 1]]  # the cockpit itself can't be walked on
      front: 4  # the nose points south (the ramp is at the north end); turns east by mirroring (a right click in drive mode)
      tuPerTile: 4
      timeUnits: 40
      crushArmor: 40
      runOverDamage: 100
